[I] Improved iconic font

[T] Nerd Fonts patches developer targeted fonts with a high number of glyphs
[T] (icons). Specifically to add a high number of extra glyphs from popular
[T] ‘iconic fonts’ such as Font Awesome, Devicons, Octicons, and others.

[U] https://www.nerdfonts.com/

[A] Ryan L McIntyre
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/font

[L] MIT
[V] 3.5.0

[D] d246f557717257331b922706be42a62762fc33be2ca1b2eeb1aae0f4 hack-nerd-fonts-3.5.0.zip !https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts/releases/download/v3.5.0/Hack.zip

runmake=0
srcdir=.
hook_add postmake 5 "cp -vf *.ttf $root$datadir/fonts/"
